id: toc-faq
name: Content page kit (jump-to-section box, numbered sections, visible FAQ)
category: content
summary: The reading-page pattern: one h1, a Jump to section card, numbered h2 sections and an FAQ whose questions mirror FAQPage JSON-LD.
requires: foundation
@@spec
- Page title is the single h1 in Headline Large (Headline Medium on phones).
- "Jump to section": a tonal card with Title Medium heading and a list of in-page links. Never hand-roll loose inline jump links.
- Sections: h2 in Headline Small, with a small numbered badge in a tonal circle. Reading column about 62rem max, line length 65 to 75 characters.
- FAQ: question as an h3 (Title Medium), answer in Body Large. Every visible question and answer is also in the page's FAQPage JSON-LD, word for word.
- Add the source line (Body Small) under any figure.
@@a11y
- Real headings, contiguous: h1, then h2, then h3 for FAQ questions.
- The jump nav is a <nav aria-label="Jump to section">. Targets have ids and scroll-margin so the sticky bar does not cover them.
- Visible FAQ and JSON-LD must match: an AI extractor reads both and a mismatch is a trust problem.
@@html
<h1 class="md-page-title">Copper vs silver for AI demand</h1>

<nav class="md-toc" aria-label="Jump to section">
  <h2 class="md-toc__title">Jump to section</h2>
  <ol class="md-toc__list">
    <li><a href="#snapshot">The numbers</a></li>
    <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<section class="md-section" id="snapshot">
  <div class="md-section__header">
    <span class="md-section__num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
    <h2 class="md-section__title">The numbers</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="md-prose">Body Large reading text goes here.</p>
</section>

<section class="md-section" id="faq">
  <div class="md-section__header">
    <span class="md-section__num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
    <h2 class="md-section__title">FAQ</h2>
  </div>
  <h3 class="md-faq__q">Which is bigger, copper or silver demand?</h3>
  <p class="md-faq__a">Answer text. It is repeated verbatim in the FAQPage JSON-LD.</p>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{ "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Which is bigger, copper or silver demand?",
    "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Answer text. It is repeated verbatim in the FAQPage JSON-LD." } }] }
</script>
@@css
.md-page-title {
  margin: 0 0 var(--sp-lg);
  font-family: var(--md-font-brand);
  font-size: var(--md-type-headline-medium-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-headline-medium-weight);
  line-height: var(--md-type-headline-medium-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-headline-medium-tracking);
}

.md-toc {
  margin: 0 0 var(--sp-2xl);
  padding: var(--sp-lg);
  border-radius: var(--shape-lg-inc);
  background: var(--md-surface-3);
}

.md-toc__title {
  margin: 0 0 var(--sp-sm);
  font-size: var(--md-type-title-medium-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-title-medium-weight);
  line-height: var(--md-type-title-medium-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-title-medium-tracking);
}

.md-toc__list {
  display: grid;
  gap: var(--sp-xs);
  margin: 0;
  padding-inline-start: var(--sp-xl);
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-medium-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-medium-line);
}
.md-toc__list a { color: var(--md-primary); }

.md-section { margin-bottom: var(--sp-2xl); scroll-margin-top: 5rem; }

.md-section__header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--sp-md);
  margin-bottom: var(--sp-md);
}

.md-section__num {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  flex: none;
  width: 2rem;
  height: 2rem;
  border-radius: var(--shape-full);
  background: var(--md-primary-container);
  color: var(--md-on-primary-container);
  font-size: var(--md-type-label-large-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-label-large-weight);
}

.md-section__title {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--md-font-brand);
  font-size: var(--md-type-headline-small-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-headline-small-weight);
  line-height: var(--md-type-headline-small-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-headline-small-tracking);
}

.md-prose {
  max-width: 62rem;
  margin: 0 0 var(--sp-lg);
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-large-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-large-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-large-tracking);
}

.md-faq__q {
  margin: var(--sp-lg) 0 var(--sp-xs);
  font-size: var(--md-type-title-medium-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-title-medium-weight);
  line-height: var(--md-type-title-medium-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-title-medium-tracking);
}

.md-faq__a {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--md-on-surface-variant);
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-large-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-large-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-large-tracking);
}

@media (min-width: 40rem) {
  .md-page-title {
    font-size: var(--md-type-headline-large-size);
    line-height: var(--md-type-headline-large-line);
  }
}
